y Bash command is about to trust stale local dist outputs. | hook — `session_start` injects the warning as `additional_context`, and a non-strict `post_tool` entry adds the mid-session `STALE DIST WARNING` to the tool result after a write, edit or matched shell command (phase 015's keyed child run) | `session_start`, `post_tool` |\n.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-mistral-vibe/references/guards-and-hooks.md:131:| `system-skill-advisor.js` | Injects the skill advisor brief into each request's system text and exposes the advisor status tool. | hook — the `pre_agent` turn-start composer routes each main-session prompt through the shared advisor handler under the `vibe` label, so the brief arrives as `additional_context` (phase 015's keyed main-session run recorded `Advisor: no skill matched.`) | `pre_agent` |\n.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-mistral-vibe/references/guards-and-hooks.md:195:`tool_name` is the qualified name, `file_system.bash`, while a `match` selector accepts either that or the short `bash` (`SKILL.md:854-858`). `tool_input` holds the model's arguments, here `command` and `timeout`. `parent_session_id` is `null` in a main session and set inside a subagent.\n.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-mistral-vibe/references/guards-and-hooks.md:207:| `0` | anything else | Failure path: free-form text, broken JSON, a scalar, an array or a schema mismatch. |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-mistral-vibe/references/guards-and-hooks.md:131:| `system-skill-advisor.js` | Injects the skill advisor brief into each request's system text and exposes the advisor status tool. | hook — the `pre_agent` turn-start composer routes each main-session prompt through the shared advisor handler under the `vibe` label, so the brief arrives as `additional_context` (phase 015's keyed main-session run recorded