{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794781314894,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffeKCKhhfHEFy30Ji","part":{"partID":"prt_1e14d43b2001kIbKDWonRdFvVW","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffeKCKhhfHEFy30Ji","messageID":"msg_1e14d2cfe001xt6rv7Rc1g4Z1i","type":"tool","id":"call_ff2db5f46bab4f5d93ca8cf6","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy for the confirming round of pass five in the vibe-hooks-doctor area.\nversion: 1.11.17.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this detached fan-out lineage. It records the dimensions still to\ncover, the findings raised so far, the approaches that worked or failed, and the next focus.\nIt is read before every review action.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nConfirming round 5b of review pass five of\n`specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`, area\n`vibe-hooks-doctor`. Target files, from `review/review-scope-5b.txt`:\n\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-runtime-mirrors-contract.test.cjs`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/claude-user-prompt-submit-hook.vitest.ts`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/vibe-prompt-advisor.vitest.ts`\n\nPlus the docs that describe them, chiefly\n`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown` and the hook contract.\n\nThe confirming question is whether the fixes for the pass-five findings hold, and whether the\nfixes added a defect. `review/verify-5/report.md` is the base: its rejected item and the limits\nrecorded in `032-review-pass-five-remediation/plan.md` D13 and in `scratch/review/report-2.txt`\nand `report-3.txt` are not re-reported without a new input that breaks them. Plan D9 freezes the\ndoctor's `match` rule, `re:` selectors included.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The transcript scorer, the behaviour arena and the live runner are the `accuracy-runner`\n  lineage's scope. Their five focus checks are read here only as context, never graded.\n- The kill-switch CLI, launcher and `ENV-REFERENCE.md` are the `kill-switch-cli` lineage's\n  scope. The hook contract is graded here only where it describes this area's code.\n- The feature catalog, changelog, playbook and leaf metadata are `docs-metadata`'s scope.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to filename searches.\n- No code changes. This lineage writes only its own directory.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below 0.10 with no active P0 and dimension coverage complete.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 3.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence.\n- Any active P0 forces `Review verdict: FAIL` regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n[None yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[Populated after iteration 1]\n\n---\n\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n[None yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Populated as iterations rule directions out]\n\n---\n\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n- Dimension: correctness and security - Focus area: the Vibe prompt part and the Claude hook resolver - Reason: both changed in the fix commit range and carry the pass-five findings R1-P2-001, R2-P2-001 and R4-P2-001 - Rotation status: none complete - Blocked/productive carry-forward: no blocked approach - Required evidence: the source, the diff, and a run of the exported helpers.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`,\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`,\n  `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`, their tests, and the hook contract.\n- Behavior claims: `review/review-brief-5b.txt`, `review/verify-5/report.md`, plan D9 and D13,\n  `032-review-pass-five-remediation/spec.md` REQ-007.\n- Reuse and conventions: hooks are standalone Node/TypeScript entry points fed a JSON event on\n  stdin; the Vibe part imports the compiled advisor; doctor scripts are plain CommonJS with\n  `node:test` suites.\n- Review risks and gaps: no live Vibe or Claude session is available, so behavior claims rest on\n  the exported helpers and the suites. The compiled advisor runtime is not tracked, so the source\n  is the reviewed artifact.\n- Out of scope: scorer arithmetic, arena building, live turns, holdout prompt text, the rest of\n  the kill-switch surface.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| the eight scoped files | - | - | - | pending |\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b-1794780590351-ezt1v0, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Started: 2026-11-15T22:21:04Z\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b lineage\\ndescription: Runtime strategy for the confirming round of pass five in the vibe-hooks-doctor area.\\nversion: 1.11.17.0\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b lineage\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for this detached fan-out lineage. It records the dimensions still to\\ncover, the findings raised so far, the approaches that worked or failed, and the next focus.\\nIt is read before every review action.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nConfirming round 5b of review pass five of\\n`specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`, area\\n`vibe-hooks-doctor`. Target files, from `review/review-scope-5b.txt`:\\n\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-runtime-mirrors-contract.test.cjs`\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/claude-user-prompt-submit-hook.vitest.ts`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/vibe-prompt-advisor.vitest.ts`\\n\\nPlus the docs that describe them, chiefly\\n`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown` and the hook contract.\\n\\nThe confirming question is whether the fixes for the pass-five findings hold, and whether the\\nfixes added a defect. `review/verify-5/report.md` is the base: its rejected item and the limits\\nrecorded in `032-review-pass-five-remediation/plan.md` D13 and in `scratch/review/report-2.txt`\\nand `report-3.txt` are not re-reported without a new input that breaks them. Plan D9 freezes the\\ndoctor's `match` rule, `re:` selectors included.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n- [ ] correctness\\n- [ ] security\\n- [ ] traceability\\n- [ ] maintainability\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The transcript scorer, the behaviour arena and the live runner are the `accuracy-runner`\\n  lineage's scope. Their five focus checks are read here only as context, never graded.\\n- The kill-switch CLI, launcher and `ENV-REFERENCE.md` are the `kill-switch-cli` lineage's\\n  scope. The hook contract is graded here only where it describes this area's code.\\n- The feature catalog, changelog, playbook and leaf metadata are `docs-metadata`'s scope.\\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to filename searches.\\n- No code changes. This lineage writes only its own directory.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below 0.10 with no active P0 and dimension coverage complete.\\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 3.\\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence.\\n- Any active P0 forces `Review verdict: FAIL` regardless of convergence.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n[None yet]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[Populated after iteration 1]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[Populated after iteration 1]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n[None yet]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Populated as iterations rule directions out]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n- Dimension: correctness and security - Focus area: the Vibe prompt part and the Claude hook resolver - Reason: both changed in the fix commit range and carry the pass-five findings R1-P2-001, R2-P2-001 and R4-P2-001 - Rotation status: none complete - Blocked/productive carry-forward: no blocked approach - Required evidence: the source, the diff, and a run of the exported helpers.\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`,\\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`,\\n  `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`, their tests, and the hook contract.\\n- Behavior claims: `review/review-brief-5b.txt`, `review/verify-5/report.md`, plan D9 and D13,\\n  `032-review-pass-five-remediation/spec.md` REQ-007.\\n- Reuse and conventions: hooks are standalone Node/TypeScript entry points fed a JSON event on\\n  stdin; the Vibe part imports the compiled advisor; doctor scripts are plain CommonJS with\\n  `node:test` suites.\\n- Review risks and gaps: no live Vibe or Claude session is available, so behavior claims rest on\\n  the exported helpers and the suites. The compiled advisor runtime is not tracked, so the source\\n  is the reviewed artifact.\\n- Out of scope: scorer arithmetic, arena building, live turns, holdout prompt text, the rest of\\n  the kill-switch surface.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| the eight scoped files | - | - | - | pending |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n\\n- Max iterations: 3\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b-1794780590351-ezt1v0, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Started: 2026-11-15T22:21:04Z\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-confirm-5b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794781299634,"end":1794781314894}}}}
