a context that starts with the directive separator as a head, so a fallback whose directive block names a command gains a Command documents line after the directives.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"prompt-advisor.mjs:125-127\",\"prompt-advisor.mjs:176-177\",\"user-prompt-submit.ts:373\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked the handler fallback shape and the sibling reduceRepeatedHead label branch; both confirm the leading-newline fallback is a real input.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The separator at index 0 could be read as a malformed brief rather than a head; either way the function must not append a document line for a command nobody offered.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"downgradeTrigger\":\"None; the line is truthful and only adds text after the directives.\",\"scopeProof\":\"The Vibe part is in the declared vibe-hooks-doctor scope; withCommandDocuments is its only document-line producer and the fallback shape is produced by the in-scope handler.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"Vibe no-brief fallback\",\"document line placement\",\"directive block\"]},{\"id\":\"R1-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The subagent guard keys on a field no Vibe source or test names, while the hook contract promises a subagent turn gets no brief\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs:64\",\"findingClass\":\"unverified_claim\",\"claim\":\n===\n       6\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-vibe-hooks-doctor-5-1794760565927-i99t40\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"correctness\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs:1-236\",\".skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/turn-start.mjs:1-162\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/vibe-prompt-advisor.vitest.ts:1-210\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts:289-465\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md:82-111\"],\"findingsCount\":2,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":[\"R1-P2-001\",\"R1-P2-002\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"R1-P2-001\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The no-brief fallback is read as a routing head, so a command named in the directive block gains a document line after the directives\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs:125\",\"findingClass\":\"boundary_parsing\",\"claim\":\"withCommandDocuments treats a context that starts with the directive separator as a head, so a fallback whose directive block names a command gains a Command documents line after the directives.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"prompt-advisor.mjs:125-127\",\"prompt-advisor.mjs:176-177\",\"user-prompt-submit.ts:373\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked the handler fallback shape and the sibling reduceRepeatedHead label branch; both confirm the leading-newline fallback is a real input.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The separator at index 0 could be read as a malformed brief rather than a head; either way the function must not append a document line for a command nobody offered.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"downgradeTrigger\":\"None; the line is truthful and only adds text after the directives.\",\"scopeProof\":\"The Vibe part is in the declared vibe-hooks-doctor scope; withCommandDocuments is its only document-line producer and the fallback shape is produced by the in-scope handler.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"Vibe no-brief fallback\",\"document line placement\",\"directive block\"]},{\"id\":\"R1-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The subagent guard keys on a field no Vibe source or test names,