{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794781759070,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffeKCKhhfHEFy30Ji","part":{"partID":"prt_1e1544316002UY1fSv1TKV24xm","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffeKCKhhfHEFy30Ji","messageID":"msg_1e1541080001fdBc3lgtOznVWv","type":"tool","id":"call_931cd782078840aba7239980","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"wc -l .skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/vibe/README.md .skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/README.md; echo ===; grep -n -i \"advisor\\|receipt\\|directive\\|document\" .skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/vibe/README.md | head -20","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"      33 .skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/vibe/README.md\n      61 .skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/README.md\n      94 total\n===\n2:title: \"Skill Advisor Hooks: Vibe Adapter Link\"\n3:description: \"Relative link to the Vibe prompt advisor part, which the turn-start composer adds to each operator message.\"\n5:  - \"skill advisor vibe hook\"\n6:  - \"vibe prompt advisor\"\n7:  - \"vibe advisor adapter\"\n11:# Skill Advisor Hooks: Vibe Adapter Link\n17:`vibe/` holds one link for the Vibe Skill Advisor path. It points at the real part in `system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/`, which the Vibe turn-start composer calls from its `pre_agent` hook. The part reads only the message the operator typed and returns the advisor brief as `additional_context`, which Vibe adds after the message for the model. A child dispatch (`AI_SESSION_CHILD=1`) and a subagent turn get no brief.\n25:| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `pre_agent`, through `.skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/turn-start.mjs` | Link to `system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`. Runs the advisor on the operator prompt under the runtime label `vibe`, and sends the routing head and the directive block again only when they changed for the session, because Vibe keeps every added context in the conversation. | Fails open. `ERROR_POLICY` is `fail-open` and the message goes through without a brief. |\n31:- [`../README.md`](../README.md): the Skill Advisor concern, its delivery model and its kill switches.\n32:- [`../../../skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`](../../../skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs): the real part behind the link.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"      33 .skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/vibe/README.md\n      61 .skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/README.md\n      94 total\n===\n2:title: \"Skill Advisor Hooks: Vibe Adapter Link\"\n3:description: \"Relative link to the Vibe prompt advisor part, which the turn-start composer adds to each operator message.\"\n5:  - \"skill advisor vibe hook\"\n6:  - \"vibe prompt advisor\"\n7:  - \"vibe advisor adapter\"\n11:# Skill Advisor Hooks: Vibe Adapter Link\n17:`vibe/` holds one link for the Vibe Skill Advisor path. It points at the real part in `system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/`, which the Vibe turn-start composer calls from its `pre_agent` hook. The part reads only the message the operator typed and returns the advisor brief as `additional_context`, which Vibe adds after the message for the model. A child dispatch (`AI_SESSION_CHILD=1`) and a subagent turn get no brief.\n25:| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `pre_agent`, through `.skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/turn-start.mjs` | Link to `system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`. Runs the advisor on the operator prompt under the runtime label `vibe`, and sends the routing head and the directive block again only when they changed for the session, because Vibe keeps every added context in the conversation. | Fails open. `ERROR_POLICY` is `fail-open` and the message goes through without a brief. |\n31:- [`../README.md`](../README.md): the Skill Advisor concern, its delivery model and its kill switches.\n32:- [`../../../skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`](../../../skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs): the real part behind the link.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"wc -l .skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/vibe/README.md .skilled/hooks/session-lifecycle/vibe/README.md; echo ===; grep -n -i \\\"advisor\\\\|receipt\\\\|directive\\\\|document\\\" .skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/vibe/README.md | head -20\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794781758230,"end":1794781759070}}}}
