{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794781987266,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffeKCKhhfHEFy30Ji","part":{"partID":"prt_1e157c00c002zJbejeYZo7mPWc","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffeKCKhhfHEFy30Ji","messageID":"msg_1e157ab7e001TiMPBm7uuM0ywh","type":"tool","id":"call_6d5bf82d15754631a715701e","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"record_terminal_gates\" -A 12 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -40","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"951:          run_first: record_terminal_gates\n952-          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n953-          note: \"The stop row is printed, not appended: the gateway refuses an event it has no ledger stem for. The reason reaches the synthesis report through the bound reason.\"\n954-        if_not_reached:\n955-          action: \"Continue with the iteration\"\n956-\n957-      step_check_pause_sentinel:\n958-        action: \"Check for pause sentinel file\"\n959-        check: \"Does {state_paths.pause_sentinel} exist?\"\n960-        if_exists:\n961-          set:\n962-            pending_stop_event: \"paused\"\n963-            pending_stop_reason: \"userPaused\"\n--\n1135:          record_terminal_gates:\n1136-            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1137-            evaluate: |\n1138-              evidence: pass when every active P0/P1 finding has concrete file:line evidence and none relies only on inference (the evidenceDensityGate rule).\n1139-              scope: pass when every active finding's file lies inside the review target.\n1140-              coverage: pass when configured dimensions and required traceability coverage are complete and coverage_age >= 1 (the dimensionCoverageGate rule).\n1141-              Evaluate all three fresh at this stop, even when an earlier blocked stop recorded failures.\n1142-              terminal_gate_results_json = JSON array of exactly three rows {\"gateId\":\"evidence\"|\"scope\"|\"coverage\",\"status\":\"pass\"|\"fail\",\"reasonCode\":\"<short code such as all-findings-cited or missing-dimensions>\",\"evidenceDigest\":\"<64 lowercase hex sha256 of the evidence summary for that gate>\"}\n1143-              failed_required_gate_ids = JSON array of the gateIds whose status is fail, in the order evidence, scope, coverage; [] when all pass\n1144-              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error, else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1145-            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n1146-            log: \"Terminal gates recorded at stop {terminal_stop_reason}. Failed required gates: {failed_required_gate_ids}\"\n1147-          branch_on: \"convergence_mode == 'divergent' AND stop_decision.reasonDetail == 'all_dimensions_clean'\"\n--\n1253:                      run_first: record_terminal_gates\n1254-                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1255-                  set:\n1256-                    next_dimension: \"{pivot_result.restoredFocus}\"\n1257-                    pivot_lineage: \"Pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} selected {pivot_result.selectedCandidate.id} from source iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1258-                    saturated_directions: \"{pivot_result.completedEvent.saturatedDirections}\"\n1259-                  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n1260-                  log: \"Divergent review pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} restored focus to {pivot_result.restoredFocus}; continuing iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1261-                  proceed_to: step_normalize_pause_events\n1262-                if_failed:\n1263-                  gate_divergent_pivot_override:\n1264-                    applies_to: confirm\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"951:          run_first: record_terminal_gates\n952-          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n953-          note: \"The stop row is printed, not appended: the gateway refuses an event it has no ledger stem for. The reason reaches the synthesis report through the bound reason.\"\n954-        if_not_reached:\n955-          action: \"Continue with the iteration\"\n956-\n957-      step_check_pause_sentinel:\n958-        action: \"Check for pause sentinel file\"\n959-        check: \"Does {state_paths.pause_sentinel} exist?\"\n960-        if_exists:\n961-          set:\n962-            pending_stop_event: \"paused\"\n963-            pending_stop_reason: \"userPaused\"\n--\n1135:          record_terminal_gates:\n1136-            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1137-            evaluate: |\n1138-              evidence: pass when every active P0/P1 finding has concrete file:line evidence and none relies only on inference (the evidenceDensityGate rule).\n1139-              scope: pass when every active finding's file lies inside the review target.\n1140-              coverage: pass when configured dimensions and required traceability coverage are complete and coverage_age >= 1 (the dimensionCoverageGate rule).\n1141-              Evaluate all three fresh at this stop, even when an earlier blocked stop recorded failures.\n1142-              terminal_gate_results_json = JSON array of exactly three rows {\"gateId\":\"evidence\"|\"scope\"|\"coverage\",\"status\":\"pass\"|\"fail\",\"reasonCode\":\"<short code such as all-findings-cited or missing-dimensions>\",\"evidenceDigest\":\"<64 lowercase hex sha256 of the evidence summary for that gate>\"}\n1143-              failed_required_gate_ids = JSON array of the gateIds whose status is fail, in the order evidence, scope, coverage; [] when all pass\n1144-              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error, else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1145-            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n1146-            log: \"Terminal gates recorded at stop {terminal_stop_reason}. Failed required gates: {failed_required_gate_ids}\"\n1147-          branch_on: \"convergence_mode == 'divergent' AND stop_decision.reasonDetail == 'all_dimensions_clean'\"\n--\n1253:                      run_first: record_terminal_gates\n1254-                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1255-                  set:\n1256-                    next_dimension: \"{pivot_result.restoredFocus}\"\n1257-                    pivot_lineage: \"Pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} selected {pivot_result.selectedCandidate.id} from source iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1258-                    saturated_directions: \"{pivot_result.completedEvent.saturatedDirections}\"\n1259-                  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n1260-                  log: \"Divergent review pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} restored focus to {pivot_result.restoredFocus}; continuing iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1261-                  proceed_to: step_normalize_pause_events\n1262-                if_failed:\n1263-                  gate_divergent_pivot_override:\n1264-                    applies_to: confirm\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"record_terminal_gates\\\" -A 12 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -40\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794781986828,"end":1794781987266}}}}
